{"id":370,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"豊かな人間性と進路を育てる東雲","feature_description":"松山東雲中学・高等学校は、キリスト教精神を土台に、豊かな人間性、きめ細かな学習指導、確かな進路保障を3本柱にする学校です。部活動も多彩で、礼節や協調を大切にしながら、自分の力を積み上げやすい環境があります。多彩な活動の中で、自分に合う居場所を見つけやすいです。部活動と進路の両方を見通しながら、落ち着いて過ごせます。穏やかな学校生活を送りやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6793,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6794,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6795,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6796,"name":"アーチェリー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6797,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6798,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6799,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6800,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6801,"name":"ハンドベル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6802,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6803,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6804,"name":"かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6805,"name":"YWCA","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://highschool.shinonome.ac.jp/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6806,"name":"合唱部","category":"文